2026-10-23: 72 real CLI groups / 4248 file conditions; 2 parser settings, 2 cops,
2 quote styles, ConsistentQuotesInMultiline true/false for StringLiterals, LF/CRLF,
inspection and both correction modes. Records retain all offense fields, summary,
exit status, original bytes and raw upstream writeback bytes. after_hex restores
only the source CRLF format, as the registered project divergence requires.
Literal runtime bytes/encoding are from Ruby, never derived from candidate output.
